description:
School holiday fun at Aotea / Great Barrier Library!&nbsp;
Looking for something creative to do these school holidays? Join our Matariki-themed colouring-in competition and be in to win!
Pop into the library to pick up your colouring sheet, then return your masterpiece before the holidays end for your chance to take home a prize.&nbsp;
Share your ideas with us! We’d love to hear from you!&nbsp;
Help shape the future of your library by telling us what you’d like to see in the space.&nbsp;Simply drop in between July 6 - 19, grab a star and write down your ideas and pop it on the wall - whether it’s new activities, resources or events. Your voice matters and we’re excited at the potential to bring your ideas to life!
Note: Aotea / Great Barrier Library will be closed for the Matariki public holiday on Friday 10 July.

Start your tamariki's engineering journey with this Vex Robotics Workshop!&nbsp;
Build, code and drive - learn the stepping-stones!
Please note that this activity is for children as part of the school holidays. Parental or caregiver supervision is required for children under 14 years old.
